gthened or added sectoral target","value":"Yes, enhancement in the revised submission"},{"id":248924296,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"THA","country":"Thailand","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Overall Comparison with Previous NDC","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ndce_pa","indicator_name":"Strengthened or added policies and actions","value":"No previous submission available"},{"id":248924484,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"THA","country":"Thailand","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Overall Comparison with Previous NDC","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ndce_pa","indicator_name":"Strengthened or added policies and actions","value":"No revision compared with previous version"},{"id":248924638,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"THA","country":"Thailand","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Overall Comparison with Previous NDC","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ndce_pa","indicator_name":"Strengthened or added policies and actions","value":"Yes, enhancement in the revised submission"},{"id":248924862,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"THA","country":"Thailand","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Overall Comparison with Previous NDC","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ndce_adp","indicator_name":"Strengthened adaptation","value":"No previous submission available"},{"id":248925050,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"THA","country":"Thailand","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Overall Comparison with Previous NDC","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ndce_adp","indicator_name":"Strengthened adaptation","value":"No revision compared with previous version"},{"id":248925204,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"THA","country":"Thailand","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Overall Comparison with Previous NDC","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ndce_adp","indicator_name":"Strengthened adaptation","value":"Yes, enhancement in the revised submission"},{"id":248925428,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"THA","country":"Thailand","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Overall Comparison with Previous NDC","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ndce_ctu","indicator_name":"Provided additional Information for clarity, transparency, and understanding","value":"No previous submission available"},{"id":248925616,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"THA","country":"Thailand","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Overall Comparison with Previous NDC","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ndce_ctu","indicator_name":"Provided additional Information for clarity, transparency, and understanding","value":"No revision compared with previous version"},{"id":248925770,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"THA","country":"Thailand","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Overall Comparison with Previous NDC","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ndce_ctu","indicator_name":"Provided additional Information for clarity, transparency, and understanding","value":"No, no enhancement in the revised submission"},{"id":248925991,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"THA","country":"Thailand","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"indc_summary","indicator_name":"NDC summary","value":"\u003cp\u003e\"Thailand intends to reduce its greenhouse gas emissions by 20 percent from the projected business-as-usual (BAU) level by 2030. The level of contribution could increase up to 25 percent, subject to adequate and enhanced access to technology development and transfer, financial resources and capacity building support through a balanced and ambitious global agreement under the United Nations Framework Convention on Climate Change (UNFCCC).\"\u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003eThe INDC also includes a section on Adaptation.\u003c/p\u003e"},{"id":248926179,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"THA","country":"Thailand","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"indc_summary","indicator_name":"NDC summary","value":"\u003cp\u003e\"Thailand intends to reduce its greenhouse gas emissions by 20 percent from the projected business-as-usual (BAU) level by 2030. The level of contribution could increase up to 25 percent, subject to adequate and enhanced access to technology development and transfer, financial resources and capacity building support through a balanced and ambitious global agreement under the United Nations Framework Convention on Climate Change (UNFCCC).\"\u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003eThe INDC also includes a section on Adaptation.\u003c/p\u003e"},{"id":248926333,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"THA","country":"Thailand","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"indc_summary","indicator_name":"NDC summary","value":"\"Thailand intends to reduce its greenhouse gas emissions by 30 percent from the projected business-as-usual (BAU) level by 2030. The level of contribution could increase up to 40 percent, subject to adequate and enhanced access to technology development and transfer, financial resources and capacity building support. Furthermore, Thailand will continue vigorous efforts in its challenge to meet the long-term goal of carbon neutrality by 2050 and net-zero greenhouse gas emission by 2065.\""},{"id":248926458,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"THA","country":"Thailand","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"indc_summary","indicator_name":"NDC summary","value":"\"Thailand aims to reduce its net GHG emissions to 152 milliontCO2eq in 2035 from its 2019 levels, which is consistent with a reduction of 135.2 MtCO2eq or 47 percent, compared to the net emissions in 2019 level. This target has been established in line with 1.5-degree pathways towards the achievement of net zero emissions by 2050.\""},{"id":248926722,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"THA","country":"Thailand","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"mitigation_contribution_type","indicator_name":"Mitigation contribution type","value":"GHG target"},{"id":248926910,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"THA","country":"Thailand","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"mitigation_contribution_type","indicator_name":"Mitigation contribution type","value":"GHG target"},{"id":248927064,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"THA","country":"Thailand","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"mitigation_contribution_type","indicator_name":"Mitigation contribution type","value":"GHG target"},{"id":248927189,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"THA","country":"Thailand","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"mitigation_contribution_type","indicator_name":"Mitigation contribution type","value":"GHG target"},{"id":248927420,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"THA","country":"Thailand","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"GHG Target","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ghg_target","indicator_name":"GHG target","value":"20% (unconditional) up to 25% (conditional) reduction in GHG emissions by 2030 compared to the BAU scenario"},{"id":248927593,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"THA","country":"Thailand","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"GHG Target","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ghg_target","indicator_name":"GHG target","value":"20% (unconditional) up to 25% (conditional) reduction in GHG emissions by 2030 compared to the BAU scenario"},{"id":248927745,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"THA","country":"Thailand","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"GHG Target","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ghg_target","indicator_name":"GHG target","value":"Thailand commits to reducing its emissions by 30% (unconditional) and by 40% (conditional) by 2030 compared to BAU."},{"id":248927870,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"THA","country":"Thailand","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"GHG Target","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ghg_target","indicator_name":"GHG target","value":"Thailand commits to reducing its net GHG emissions to 152 million tCO2eq in 2035 compared to 2019 levels, which is equaivalent to a 47 percent reduction."},{"id":248928128,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"THA","country":"Thailand","global_category":"Mitigation, Overview","overview_category":"GHG Target, Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ghg_target_type","indicator_name":"GHG target type","value":"Baseline scenario target"},{"id":248928313,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"THA","country":"Thailand","global_category":"Mitigation, Overview","overview_category":"GHG Target, Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ghg_target_type","indicator_name":"GHG target type","value":"Baseline scenario target"},{"id":248928467,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"THA","country":"Thailand","global_category":"Mitigation, Overview","overview_category":"GHG Target, Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ghg_target_type","indicator_name":"GHG target type","value":"Baseline scenario target"},{"id":248928592,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"THA","country":"Thailand","global_category":"Mitigation, Overview","overview_category":"GHG Target, Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ghg_target_type","indicator_name":"GHG target type","value":"Base year target; Trajectory target"},{"id":248928769,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"THA","country":"Thailand","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"non_ghg_target","indicator_name":"Non-GHG target","value":"\u003cp\u003e\u0026ldquo;Ambitious targets are defined in the Power Development Plan (PDP), the Alternative Energy Development Plan (AEDP) and the Energy Efficiency Plan (EEP). For example, the PDP sets a target to achieve a 20% share of power generation from renewable sources in 2036. The AEDP aims to achieve a 30% share of renewable energy in the total final energy consumption in 2036.\u0026rdquo;\u003c/p\u003e"},{"id":248928853,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"THA","country":"Thailand","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"non_ghg_target","indicator_name":"Non-GHG target","value":"\u003cp\u003e\u0026ldquo;Ambitious targets are defined in the Power Development Plan (PDP), the Alternative Energy Development Plan (AEDP) and the Energy Efficiency Plan (EEP). For example, the PDP sets a target to achieve a 20% share of power generation from renewable sources in 2036. The AEDP aims to achieve a 30% share of renewable energy in the total final energy consumption in 2036.\u0026rdquo;\u003c/p\u003e"},{"id":248928956,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"THA","country":"Thailand","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"non_ghg_target","indicator_name":"Non-GHG target","value":"\"The commitment to increase forest cover of the country to achieve 55% of the total country area by 2037 has been setup under the 20-Year National Strategy.\""},{"id":248929187,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"THA","country":"Thailand","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indica